Description: An end-to-end workflow for putting one gene of interest in the
    context of a whole RNA-Seq experiment. Reads either a plain count table or
    Salmon quantifications, runs differential expression with 'DESeq2',
    annotates the results with 'biomaRt', and produces the figures, quality
    control plots, disease and pathway annotations and a self-contained HTML
    report for that gene. A 'shiny' interface exposes the same workflow
    without writing code, and an optional large-language-model assistant
    answers questions about a finished run.
